BAUXBSD bterm - suckless terminal with BAUX theming and scaling fonts

bterm is a customized version of st (suckless terminal) with:
- BAUX Gruvbox color scheme
- JetBrains Mono nerd font with ligatures
- Xresources support for runtime font scaling
- Multiple fallback fonts for glyph coverage
- Scrollback buffer support
- Optimized for BAUX workflow

